{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10265","headline":"送萧颖士赴东府得往字 · 郑愕","name":"送萧颖士赴东府得往字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"斤溪数亩田，素心拟长往。\n繄君曲得引，使我缨俗网。\n风尘岂不劳，道义成心赏。\n春郊桃李月，忍此戒征两。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑愕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10265.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10265","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}